    <i class="fas fa-directions me-1"></i> Get Directions to Kopar Khairane
  </a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-4">
<div class="text-gold me-3 fs-4"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i></div>
<div>
<h5 class="text-white h6 font-luxury mb-1">Call Us Directly</h5>
<p class="small text-muted mb-0"><a class="text-muted text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="tel:+918369297174">+91 83692 97174</a></p>
