      </div>
      <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Shop 02, Om Sai Apartment, Prabhakar Krishanati Patil Marg, Talvali, Vaman, Ghansoli, Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra 400701</p>
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
        <span class="small text-muted"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt text-gold me-1" style="color: #189ba6 !important;"></i> <a href="tel:+918369297174" class="text-muted text-decoration-none">+91 83692 97174</a></span>
        <span class="small text-muted"><i class="fas fa-clock text-gold me-1" style="color: #189ba6 !important;"></i> 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-end mb-3">
        <a class="btn btn-sm text-white px-3 py-1" style="background: #189ba6; font-size: 0.75rem; text-decoration: none;" href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=14973846516803531003" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
